abstract: >
  This dataset contains results and input data for the e-fuels supply potentials project,
  which models North American energy transition pathways under various sustainable aviation
  fuel (SAF / e-kerosene) blending mandates. The archive includes 10 scenario runs
  (US_scenario_01 through US_scenario_10), each consisting of solved PyPSA-Earth network
  files and solver logs, plus the ERA5 North America cutout used for renewable resource
  assessment.
